# Nested Tabs Check

## Setup

Evaluate this cell first to install Kino.

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:kino, "~> 0.19.0"}
])
```

## Nested tabs

Evaluate this cell after setup. It renders outer tabs Alpha and Beta, with inner tabs One and Two inside Alpha.

```elixir
inner = Kino.Layout.tabs(One: Kino.Markdown.new("Alpha One content"), Two: Kino.Markdown.new("Alpha Two content"))

Kino.Layout.tabs(Alpha: inner, Beta: Kino.Markdown.new("Beta content"))
```
